The installed SDK supports `store_task=False` and `temperature=0`. It has no dedicated token-cap argument; `llm.prompt` accepts provider parameters through `extra_api_params`, including `max_output_tokens`. I’ll use that route and keep the task’s item loop sequential so it needs no pandas dependency.
